{"articleNo":"70319","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=70319&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[12.3~6]2012학년도 2학기 사회봉사활동확인서 제출 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.11.22","hit":"6766","attachments":[{"name":"사회봉사과목운영지침.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=70319&attachNo=2243"},{"name":"사회봉사활동 확인서(양식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=70319&attachNo=2268"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 18pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">2012학년도 2학기 사회봉사활동확인서 제출 안내</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp; 2012학년도 2학기 사회봉사활동 확인서 제출에 관한 사항을 아래와 같이 안내 하오니, </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 13pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">해당 학생은 지정 기간 내에 제출하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">1. 제출대상자 :</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">2012학년도 2학기에 사회봉사과목을 수강신청 한 학생 중 실제로</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\"> 사회</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 봉사활동을</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"> 수행한 학생</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 85.9pt; TEXT-INDENT: -85.9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">2. 제출서류 : 사회봉사 활동확인서 원본</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 73.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -73.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(본교 사회봉사활동확인서 양식 및 사회봉사활동 기관에서 발급한 사회봉사활동확인서 등 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 73.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -73.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 사회봉사기관명, 사회봉사 활동 총시간이 확인 가능한 원본 서류이면 가능함) </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 117.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -117.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 117.5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -117.5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">3. 사회봉사기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2012. 6. 1(금)&nbsp; ～ 2012. 11. 30(금)까지 수행</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">한 봉사활동</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">4. 제출기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">2012. 12. 3(월) ～ 12. 6(목)까지</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 94.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -94.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">☞ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">학적부에 사진(학사서비스센터 ☎478-7066)이 없거나 학적부기재 사항</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">(영문명,</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\"> </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 94.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -94.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1.2pt\">한자명, 주소, E-maiil, 연락처)이 정확하지 않은 경우 사회봉사활동 확인서 제출</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">이</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\"> 불가능하니 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 94.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -94.3pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;반드시 확인하시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 93.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -93.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.7pt\">사회봉사활동 인정 기관 및 그 외 문의사항은 해당 종합학사행정실로</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\"> 하시기 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 93.8pt; TEXT-INDENT: -93.8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 바랍니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">5. 제출장소</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"> : 해당 종합학사행정실</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">6. 사회봉사 학점 인정 이수시간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"> : 30시간 이상 이수 시 1학점 인정</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">7. 사회봉사활동의 범위와 대상</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 국가, 지방자치단체, 공공기관 등에서 실시한 봉사활동</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 34pt; TEXT-INDENT: -34pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 국</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">가, 지방자치단체, 공공기관에 등록된 사회복지기관 및 시설에서 실시한 봉사활동</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 농어촌 봉사, 환경정화, 자연보호, 의료봉사 활동</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;라. 기타 학부장이 인정하는 봉사활동</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;마. 헌혈(사회봉사1, 사회봉사2 각각 1회에 한하여 4시간 인정)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">8. 기타사항</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 11pt; TEXT-INDENT: -11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">사회</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">봉사활동 확인서(양식)이 필요한 학생은 우리학교 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.6pt\">홈페이지 - 교육·학사 - 자료실에서 다운로드</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">하여</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"> 사용 가능</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">9. 문의전화</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;-</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">테크노관종합학사행정실&nbsp; ☎478-7360</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 디지털관종합학사행정실&nbsp; ☎478-7752</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 글로벌관종합학사행정실&nbsp; ☎478-7597</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 교무처&nbsp; ☎478-7031</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">2012.&nbsp; 11.&nbsp; 22.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: '돋움'\">교 무 처 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
